Much cleaner. Menu looks good. Now inspect the intro and game screens. Update shot.gd to navigate.

I'll create a more flexible screenshot script: after 5 frames, call `_start_scenario(0)`, wait 5 frames, capture intro, then `_show_game()` and capture game. But saving images from root viewport with a window requires process frames. We'll write a script with a frame counter and stages.

